# Byte-pinned across repos, same failure mode as the line above but verified by exact diff against another tree instead of hashed in a test. Two
# separate statements, easy to conflate: lines 1-159 are a don't-touch region (our four-line head — title, blank, provenance sentence, blank — plus the
# copy), while the identity claim is narrower, our 5-159 === ../claude-agents-dashboard/.claude/DESIGN.md 3-157, 155 lines,
# sha256 89a69b26766f0144b740a31229e9c0290fe225701ba6c9af1a09a1a134e640ac. That one hash is BOTH sides — being the same number is what the check
# asserts. Line 160 opens section 8, which is this app's own writing and not copied from anywhere.
